item.description:
Soil Health Card reports on AgricultureResource v0.2. One capability, ONE action: select takes the farmer's registered mobile and a cycle (e.g. 2024-25) and returns SHC's GraphQL answer unchanged in resourceAttributes. SHC takes 15-26 s per query, so the binding is not retried.

Run Registry, Publish and Discover first, then Select. Set shc-mobile to a mobile registered with SHC; it is left empty here because it is a farmer's own number.

@context is the official AgricultureResource address; the adapter's extendedSchema_contextRewrite reads it from network-specs bv-migration until v0.2 is on GitHub Pages.

